     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<br>my app uses numerous tabs and dynamic-generated input. Here is a reproductible example :<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">request</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;main&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tab1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;renderTab1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tab2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;renderTab2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      footer </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bookmarkButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$renderTab1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    tagList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;text1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Write your text&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ok&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;OK&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  output$renderTab2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    h3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$text1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$ok</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    updateTabsetPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;main&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tab2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>enableBookmarking</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">store </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;url&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>When I restore a session from a bookmarked state, inputs are not updated as long as I have not selected the tab where the input is located (in that example, I need to select tab1 in order to display <code><span style=\"color:#000\">h3(input$text1)</span></code>).<br><br>As a workaround, I&#39;m using <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">delay(1, updateTabsetPanel(&quot;tab&quot;))</span>, but maybe there is a better solution for that problem?<br><br>Best regards<br></div>"
